Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 21:00:53 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 003/207] server: enforce required DeepSeek tools in DSML
 markup

Recognize the native template call envelope and emit structural tags with each offered argument schema. Preserve named-tool filtering and parallel-call policy, and parse the grammar envelope through both whole replies and streamed prefixes.

Host tests cover the actual template, schema alternatives, named calls, typed arguments and every streaming byte boundary. Formatting, zero new lean identities and the complete CPU gate set pass against the pinned upstream baseline.
